@startuml
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class User
class Group
class Membership
class Expense
class ExpenseSplit
class ApprovalDecision
class Obligation
class Payment
class BalanceCalculator
class Report <<query result>>
User "1" -- "0..*" Membership
Group "1" -- "0..*" Membership
Group "1" -- "0..*" Expense
Expense "1" *-- "1..*" ExpenseSplit
Expense "1" -- "0..*" ApprovalDecision
Expense "1" -- "0..*" Obligation : approved expense yields
Obligation "1" <-- "0..*" Payment : settlement matching open
ExpenseSplit ..> User : participant
Expense ..> User : payer
ApprovalDecision ..> User : approver
Payment ..> User : sender / recipient
BalanceCalculator ..> Obligation
BalanceCalculator ..> Payment
Report ..> Expense
Report ..> Payment
Report ..> BalanceCalculator
note right of Obligation
Created/activated only after required approval.
Amounts and balances use BigDecimal.
Currency, scale, rounding, allocation unresolved.
end note
note bottom of Membership
Removal and historical membership semantics open.
end note
@enduml
